    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `encrypt_payload.py` that encrypts a plaintext payload with a managed key using a concrete external provider, I will use the AWS Key Management Service (KMS) as the provider. This is identifiable by the use of the `boto3` library, which is the AWS SDK for Python, and the specific KMS service calls. </thinking>\n",
